{"manifest":"{\"format\":1,\"version\":\"5.0.4\",\"notes\":\"5.0.4 — Kovan beta 0.0.10: Obfuscate aracı (Kodlama kategorisi; çok dilli kaynak obfuscator — Java, C, C++, Rust, C#, Go, Zig, Kotlin, Pascal, Fortran, D; tamamen istemci tarafında, yorum/boşluk temizliği + desteklenen dillerde güvenliği kanıtlanabilir yerel değişken adı karıştırma) birleştirildi. 5.0.1–5.0.3'teki Oyun Ayarlayıcı (Steam/Epic algılama, grafik ön ayarı/çözünürlük, hedef FPS, iç içe ayar dosyası bulma) de dahildir.\",\"minLoader\":1,\"created\":\"2026-11-01T16:56:55.669Z\",\"files\":{\"StatScan.html\":{\"sha256\":\"8ee1ffca19d670a5210c9f8b6d136e58348d40895c05e3ce1695022bea43a0ef\",\"size\":1280369},\"desktop/app.js\":{\"sha256\":\"8faa5de2e942169df39c3c8d683d8b34b72b8a90c0d10c296c8ef6878b0b34b4\",\"size\":12956},\"desktop/assets/icon.ico\":{\"sha256\":\"b0d623d0b828bcf7603ee02ac7b5cc8e9b27b13fdb5c3eff548f2cb7b7963543\",\"size\":372526},\"desktop/assets/icon.png\":{\"sha256\":\"6ce7c330fdcf2d8785ba7ea16895cc376bfbb22b4ee061da7a0692002c3ca376\",\"size\":99730},\"desktop/host.js\":{\"sha256\":\"7538912019a7c42916b1c07f4b7ae89c40818ae0fa7a5faaabb284f71e84ff53\",\"size\":232778},\"desktop/preload.js\":{\"sha256\":\"4291d63ff6b85b2b49bb16e0330173714a85e822f1a12c8a6931ce34b00f1f35\",\"size\":5643},\"dyn/collector.ps1\":{\"sha256\":\"3329b8cdf5257002b1f0fbe10bbc0da8ed09103d33ff67618ab8d897a61b71cb\",\"size\":39356},\"dyn/README-dinamik.md\":{\"sha256\":\"da91e62f58ce365cdec59c1ec4b689c8cf0412e742c1ea728d8ba09394485b0d\",\"size\":7201},\"dyn/statscan-dyn.js\":{\"sha256\":\"bfc3f746e061f22ae93f36968e0952f2162470b39534a2d3f8c6489795b0f883\",\"size\":115235}}}","sig":"mFO9Dqc7KpQU1raYXhp5g+d5K0mi5JWveFqFJXA+pHz6010YruXrh7+wY0xWUMyKRr0oZcB3QyWlyvLOK2HtAA==","data":{"StatScan.html":"","desktop/app.js":"","desktop/assets/icon.ico":"","desktop/assets/icon.png":"","desktop/host.js":"","desktop/preload.js":"","dyn/collector.ps1":"","dyn/README-dinamik.md":"","dyn/statscan-dyn.js":""}}